{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-2005010","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-2005010-handbook-monster-2005010-0","text":"为了挽救危局，吞下「赤月」，坠入狂怒的天击将军。\n被往日陷阵厮杀的心魔所夺，飞霄成了不知疲倦的斗神化身。作为她的朋友和眼前的敌人，你们明白，唯一的「解药」…只有坚持鏖战。","speaker":""}]}
